WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.438
Let’s walk through Read the live tracker.

00:00:02.438 --> 00:00:06.025
Confirm Strategic Orientation, move, phase, countdown,

00:00:06.025 --> 00:00:08.675
and paused or running state before writing.

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:11.037
If the tracker and the room disagree, resolve the

00:00:11.037 --> 00:00:13.475
shared White Cell state instead of attaching work to the

00:00:13.475 --> 00:00:14.738
wrong window.

00:00:14.738 --> 00:00:17.175
On this slide, the header shows the current state

00:00:17.175 --> 00:00:20.587
, including Strategic Orientation before Move 1, the active

00:00:20.587 --> 00:00:23.312
move or phase, countdown timer, and whether the

00:00:23.312 --> 00:00:24.900
timer is running.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:27.062
White Cell controls these values;

00:00:27.062 --> 00:00:29.837
use them to pace deliberation and submissions.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:34.072
In practice, confirm the active window before writing.

00:00:34.072 --> 00:00:37.335
A sound record attached to the wrong move or phase

00:00:37.335 --> 00:00:39.535
is still operationally wrong.

00:00:39.535 --> 00:00:42.922
Use the highlighted Live tracker area as your visual reference

00:00:42.922 --> 00:00:44.610
while you complete this check.
